***      RESULTATSIDOR                                                          
                                                                                
  REPORT RAPPORT-A1                                          +                  
         PRINTER W33050D2                                    +                  
         LINESIZE 121                                        +                  
         PAGESIZE 41                                         +                  
         TITLESKIP 0                                         +                  
         SPACE 1                                             +                  
